<section class="quality-story">
  <div class="quality-story-container">
    <div class="quality-story-item">
      <div class="quality-story-image">
        <img src="/media-assets/specialty1.png" alt="Premium Coffee Quality" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="quality-story-content">
        <div class="quality-story-number">01</div>
        <h3 class="quality-story-heading">Sourced from the Finest Korean Coffee Regions</h3>
        <p class="quality-story-text">
          We select only the finest beans from Korea's most renowned growing regions.
          Each bean is carefully tended, harvested at peak ripeness, and processed using
          traditional methods combined with modern technology to deliver the richest,
          most authentic flavor profile.
        </p>
        <a href="/coffee-quality" class="quality-story-btn">Learn More →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quality-story-item reverse">
      <div class="quality-story-image">
        <img src="/media-assets/specialty3.png" alt="Premium Tea Quality" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="quality-story-content">
        <div class="quality-story-number">02</div>
        <h3 class="quality-story-heading">Hand-Selected Tea Leaves from Mountain Highlands</h3>
        <p class="quality-story-text">
          From the misty highlands, we bring you the finest tea leaves. Each leaf is
          hand-picked and specially processed to preserve its natural flavor and beneficial
          properties. Our tea is more than a beverage — it's an experience of Korean
          nature and culture.
        </p>
        <a href="/tea-quality" class="quality-story-btn">Learn More →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
